From f98c9e9fb377659b291a8d8cded33b116f74e84f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:24:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] Seer: artist-first search, discography pages and a new
 catalog UI

Searching an artist's name now returns that artist, their albums and songs
instead of titles that contain the words. MusicBrainz calls are retried on
503/429 and cached for 10 minutes. New endpoints browse an artist's
discography and an album's tracklist; requests keep a cover id.

The Requests page is redesigned with Cover Art Archive covers: best result,
songs, artists and albums on search, artist and album pages, and a
requests list with live status pills.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

